#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:131
msgid ""
"The plugin for infinite scrolling is extremely easy to set up on any "
"website. Anyone (even the beginners) can easily set it up. With zero coding "
"knowledge, you can easily customize Catch Infinite Scroll plugin your way "
"and enjoy the infinite scrolling on your website."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:135
msgid "Incredible Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:136
msgid ""
"We have a great line of support team and support documentation. You do not "
"need to worry about how to use the plugins we provide, just refer to our "
"Tech Support Forum. Further, if you need to do advanced customization to "
"your website, you can always hire our theme customizer!"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:140
msgid "Infinite Scroll"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:141
msgid ""
"One of the most amazing features that Catch Infinite Scroll carries is the "
"infinite scrolling feature. If you want to engage your users to your "
"content, then infinite scrolling is the best option to go for. With the "
"feature enabled, the content will load automatically as the user reaches the "
"end of a page."
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:145
#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:203
msgid "Lightweight"
msgstr ""

#: ../admin/partials/catch-infinite-scroll-admin-display.php:146
